.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-order-forms-void - Void an order form


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago order-forms void  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint voids an order form, with the \fBmanual\fR reason, and cascades to the quote version it was generated from, which is voided with the \fBcascade_of_voided\fR reason.
Only a \fBgenerated\fR order form can be voided, so a \fB422\fR is returned once the order form has been signed, has expired or has already been voided.
A concurrent write on the same quote is reported as a \fB422\fR rather than retried, so a duplicated call can fail while the first one is still in flight.
This is a premium feature.


